{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>HonestScan 是一款將收據、文件、合約與學習筆記掃描成可編輯文字的生產力工具，適合需要整理紙本資料、核對內容並保存或轉交文件的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-18.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掃描校正與匯出</h2>\n<p>HonestScan 支援邊緣偵測與透視校正掃描，也可匯入相片；光學字元辨識在裝置上處理，讓文字與原掃描並排編輯。它保留 Markdown 的標題、段落、清單、表格與頁面分界，並可檢查收據金額及增值稅警示。匯出前可預覽壓縮效果，保存含可搜尋文字層的 PDF、修正後的 Markdown 或附原掃描與圖片的 ZIP。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-10-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-11-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-12-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-13-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-14-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-15-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：HonestScan</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/honestscan/id6824215752?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.182046+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T14:09:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:58:57.539563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:58.383238+00:00","content_hash":"1c96ed8a501361e5ed8d4a352af7f869aa871636b2779fa0dbf8557c272c52a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}